        "sid": "1SA 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dwe acel doŋ okato, Nakac ma jo Ammon ocito orumo gaŋ me Jabec-gilead ki monnye; ci jo ducu ma i Jabec guwaco bot Nakac ni, “Ber icikke kwedwa, ci wabidoko luticci.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Nakac ogamo doggi ni, “Abicikke kwedwu kit man: abikolo wanwu tuŋ acuc woko ducu, wek aket ki lewic i kom jo Icrael ducu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ludoŋo ma i Jabec gugamo kun giwacci, “Koŋ imiwa nino abiro wek wacwal lukwena i lobo Icrael ducu, Ka pe onen ŋatti mo ma larowa, ci wabimine kenwa boti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lukwena gubino i Gibea i gaŋ pa Caulo, gutito lokke bot lwak; ci lwak ducu guwo ki koko matek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno onoŋo Caulo oa ki i poto, obedo ka lubo ŋe twoni pur, ci owacci, “Aŋo mutimme? Piŋo dano tye ka koko?” Ci gititte lok kom jo Jabec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Caulo owinyo lokke, ci Cwiny pa Lubaŋa obino ki tek i kome, kun kiniga omake madwoŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwanyo twoni pur aryo, otoŋogi, matitino, ci ocwalo ‘I cin lukwena oromo kwede i lobo Icrael ducu kun giwaco ni, “Dano mo ma pe obino olubo kor Caulo ki Camuel, gibitimo twon purre kit menol” Lworo omako dano matek pi Rwot, mumiyo gumol gubino ki cwiny acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Caulo oryeyo lwak i Bejek, okwanogi, ci jo Icrael guromo alip miya adek, ki jo Juda guromo alip pyeradek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci guwaco bot lukwena ma gubino botgi ni, “Wuwac bot jo Jabec-gilead ni, ‘Dikki ka cen odoko lyet gibilarowu.’ ” Ka lukwena ‘gucito gutito bot jo Jabec, cwinygi obedo yom matek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En aye omiyo jo Jabec guwaco bot jo Ammon ni, “Wabimine kenwa di ki i ciŋwu, ci wubitimowa kit ma wumito ducu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwone Caulo opo ko mony i buca adek; ci gucoro i dye gony pa jo Ammon kwarpiny, gucako nekogi o wa i dyeceŋ, Jo ma gubwotte guket woko, pe inoŋo jo aryo ma gudoŋ kacel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka otum, lwak owaco bot Camuel ni, “Aŋagi ma yam owacci, ‘Caulo aye biloyowa bo?’ Gikel jo-nu wek wanekgi woko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Caulo ogamo ni, “Pe tin gineko iye dano mo, pien tin aye Rwot olaro jo Icrael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Camuel dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Wubin, wacitu i Gilgal, wek wacikweru ker odoco kunnu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumiyo lwak ducu gucito i Gilgal, ci guketo Caulo me bedo kabaka i nyim Rwot kunnu. Gutyero gityer lakwecwiny kunnu i nyim Rwot, ci Caulo ki jo Icrael ducu cwinygi obedo yom mada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
